# Bring an idea to life

A good first project can be small. Choose a question, make a simple version, and decide what evidence would show whether it works.

## A simple example

Use a project notebook to record choices and unexpected results. A useful reflection explains what you tried and what you would change next.

**Useful relationship:** completion = finished / total × 100

## Pause and try

Draft a project brief with a goal, a first experiment, and one way to check success.

